<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.9.11">
<l>nāmaṅka ḷāyira muṭaiyanamperu māṉaṭimēl</l>
<l>cēmaṅko ṭeṉkurukūrccaṭakōpaṉ ṟērinturaitta</l>
<l>nāmaṅka ḷāyirattuḷ ḷuvaipattun tiruvallavāḻ</l>
<l>cēmaṅko ṭeṉṉakarmēl ceppuvārciṟan tārpiṟantē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Those who speak, on the protective southern temple</l>
<l>of Tiruvallavāḻ, these ten among the thousand on [his] names,</l>
<l>clearly told by Caṭakōpaṉ from southern Kurukūr, taking protection</l>
<l>at the feet of our great lord who possesses a thousand names,</l>
<l>will be superior in [the next] birth.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
